[TITLE]
IO-29 the same transect with an X1 line in each of the two layouts

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS     CFS
FLOW_ROUTING   DYNWAVE
START_DATE     01/01/2020
START_TIME     00:00:00
END_DATE       01/01/2020
END_TIME       01:00:00
REPORT_STEP    00:15:00
ROUTING_STEP   5

[JUNCTIONS]
;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1     100   10        0          0         0
J2     100   10        0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
O1     99    FREE
O2     99    FREE

[CONDUITS]
;Name  From  To  Length  N     Z1  Z2  Q0  Qmax
C1     J1    O1  1000    0.03  0   0   0   0
C2     J2    O2  1000    0.03  0   0   0   0

[XSECTIONS]
C1     IRREGULAR  T1
C2     IRREGULAR  T2

[INFLOWS]
J1     FLOW  ""  FLOW  1.0  1.0  20
J2     FLOW  ""  FLOW  1.0  1.0  20

[TRANSECTS]
;T1 and T2 are the same channel with a meander factor (Lfactor) of 2.0.
;T1: X1 line as the GUI writes it, two placeholder zeros (10 items)
;    X1 Name Nsta Xleft Xright 0 0 Lfactor Wfactor Eoffset
NC  0.05  0.05  0.03
X1  T1  4  10  30  0  0  2.0  0  0
GR  105 0   100 10   100 30   105 40
;T2: X1 line as the manual documents it, three placeholder zeros (11 items)
;    X1 Name Nsta Xleft Xright 0 0 0 Lfactor Wfactor Eoffset
NC  0.05  0.05  0.03
X1  T2  4  10  30  0  0  0  2.0  0  0
GR  105 0   100 10   100 30   105 40

[REPORT]
INPUT  YES
NODES  ALL
LINKS  ALL
